<H1 align="center">Evaluations of Series</H1>

<h3>Organizers</h3>
<p>
<UL>

<li>
Victor Edneral
(<a href="mailto:edneral@theory.npi.msu.su">edneral@theory.npi.msu.su</a>)<br>
<ADDRESS>
Institute for Nuclear Physics of Moscow University, <br>
